# Deprecated configuration placeholder.
#
# The previous version incorrectly placed a Cloudflare Email Service
# `send_email` binding on the Pages project. Pages Functions document only a
# supported subset of bindings; Hermes now uses:
#
# Pages Function -> Service Binding -> dedicated Email Worker -> send_email
#
# Use these reviewed JSONC examples instead:
#
# - wrangler.jsonc.example
# - workers/lead-email/wrangler.jsonc.example
#
# Keep LEAD_DELIVERY_MODE off until the sender domain, fixed destination,
# encrypted shared token, KV namespace and synthetic preview delivery have all
# been verified in the authenticated Cloudflare account.
